    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<strong>Prophecy of Ashen is a medieval fantasy role-playing game (CRPG) featuring deep social conflicts, religious faith, and power struggles. Players will enter a world filled with fire and ash, exploring the kingdom's borders, the mysterious Cinderkin, a corrupt Church, and a cataclysm threatening to engulf the entire continent.</strong><br><br><strong>In the game, you play as a crucial messenger navigating the kingdom's political whirlpools and religious conflicts. Through interacting with different factions and uncovering the secrets behind the Sacred Flames, you will face unavoidable choices: remain loyal to the commands of the Kingdom and Church, or side with the frenzied Cinderkin to challenge the status quo of society?</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508730/extras/62fc69112afa8527f25ed105efb30e8c.webp?t=1754908167\" width=615 height=54 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508730/extras/de0d205dbffb32cf62b8a6bf8cda786b.poster.avif?t=1754908167\" width=680 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508730/extras/de0d205dbffb32cf62b8a6bf8cda786b.webm?t=1754908167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508730/extras/de0d205dbffb32cf62b8a6bf8cda786b.mp4?t=1754908167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>In this world filled with hostility and division, every choice you make will profoundly impact the kingdom's fate and the story's course. Rich role-playing mechanics put you face-to-face with critical decisions, shaping a unique adventure.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508730/extras/73ac4c0c47716844fce6e9b918c6088d.webp?t=1754908167\" width=615 height=54 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508730/extras/4ff6043ab556f7b79a88c15e91172f6a.poster.avif?t=1754908167\" width=680 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508730/extras/4ff6043ab556f7b79a88c15e91172f6a.webm?t=1754908167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508730/extras/4ff6043ab556f7b79a88c15e91172f6a.mp4?t=1754908167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Delve into a kingdom deeply shaped by the &quot;Three Sacred Flames&quot; faith. Experience intense conflicts fueled by racial differences (especially concerning the Cinderkin) and religious divides. Learn the backgrounds of the Cinderkin and the Sacred Verdict Tribunal, making difficult choices caught between morality and faith.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508730/extras/45843317d18ec00c661fa8bf32aa47e3.webp?t=1754908167\" width=615 height=54 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508730/extras/b03afa64e51e8e4c1ceeadd93db3551b.poster.avif?t=1754908167\" width=680 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508730/extras/b03afa64e51e8e4c1ceeadd93db3551b.webm?t=1754908167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508730/extras/b03afa64e51e8e4c1ceeadd93db3551b.mp4?t=1754908167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Engage in tense, tactical turn-based battles. Utilize magic, weapons, and terrain advantages to devise strategies and defeat enemies. Facing Cinderkin uprisings, monster invasions, and enemy kingdom expansion, your tactical decisions will determine victory or defeat on the battlefield.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508730/extras/59867772e7244a177e73c9651a3adc4b.webp?t=1754908167\" width=615 height=54 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508730/extras/c23ea323df2e3cd5eb77cc3adf3d02de.poster.avif?t=1754908167\" width=614 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508730/extras/c23ea323df2e3cd5eb77cc3adf3d02de.webm?t=1754908167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508730/extras/c23ea323df2e3cd5eb77cc3adf3d02de.mp4?t=1754908167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Freely develop your character! Choose skills, magic, and equipment paths. Collaborate with the Church to become a holy warrior, or independently seek the truth of the Cinderkin as a mystic mage. Simultaneously explore a vast and captivating world \u2013 every location (ruins, villages, war-torn cities) holds unique stories intricately interwoven with the kingdom's past and your own future.</strong>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Prophecy of Ashen is a medieval fantasy role-playing game (CRPG) featuring deep social conflicts, religious faith, and power struggles. Players will enter a world filled with fire and ash, exploring the kingdom's borders, the mysterious Cinderkin, a corrupt Church, and a cataclysm threatening to engulf the entire continent.</strong><br><br><strong>In the game, you play as a crucial messenger navigating the kingdom's political whirlpools and religious conflicts. Through interacting with different factions and uncovering the secrets behind the Sacred Flames, you will face unavoidable choices: remain loyal to the commands of the Kingdom and Church, or side with the frenzied Cinderkin to challenge the status quo of society?</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508730/extras/62fc69112afa8527f25ed105efb30e8c.webp?t=1754908167\" width=615 height=54 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508730/extras/de0d205dbffb32cf62b8a6bf8cda786b.poster.avif?t=1754908167\" width=680 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508730/extras/de0d205dbffb32cf62b8a6bf8cda786b.webm?t=1754908167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508730/extras/de0d205dbffb32cf62b8a6bf8cda786b.mp4?t=1754908167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>In this world filled with hostility and division, every choice you make will profoundly impact the kingdom's fate and the story's course. Rich role-playing mechanics put you face-to-face with critical decisions, shaping a unique adventure.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/st